{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Sound Baths & Immersive Sessions</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A sensory series of sound baths in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Explore events, private sessions, and what to bring for a restorative experience." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body class="earthy">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav" id="mainNav">
        <a href="events.html">Gather</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Notes</a>
        <a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
      <button id="navToggle" class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="eyebrow">{{TAGLINE}}</h1>
          <h2 class="title">An invitation to attune — sound as the architecture of rest</h2>
          <p class="lede">We design slow, ceremonial sound baths rooted in bodily sensation and held in safety. Each evening layers crystal bowls, chimes, and the deep bloom of a gong to guide you into an embodied pause.</p>
          <p class="meta">Next event: <strong>{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong> at {{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="events.html">See upcoming</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="book.html">Reserve a seat</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pattern-layer"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="myth_vs_truth" class="content-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Myth & Truth</h3>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Myth: It’s passive background noise</h4>
            <p>Truth: Sound bathing is an embodied practice. Instruments create tactile vibrations you often feel in the chest and bones; attention to breath and posture amplifies integration.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Myth: You need spiritual experience</h4>
            <p>Truth: Everyone is welcome. We give grounded guidance for first-timers and seasoned listeners alike, tuning the session to the group’s needs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pillars" class="pillars content-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Foundational Pillars</h3>
        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <div class="pillar">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg>
            <h4>Sensory Design</h4>
            <p>Deliberate soundscapes combining crystal bowls, tuning forks, and soft chimes to shape breath and attention.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4"/></svg>
            <h4>Safety & Consent</h4>
            <p>Clear guidance, rest options, and a contraindications briefing ensure sessions are accessible and held responsibly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 L12 22"/></svg>
            <h4>Anchored Flow</h4>
            <p>We craft an arc: arrival, attunement, deep immersion, gentle return — a ritual rhythm you can feel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="case_notes" class="content-block muted">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Case Notes & Echoes</h3>
        <div class="notes-grid">
          <blockquote class="note">"The gong softened stuck places I didn’t know were held. I left lighter and quieter." — A. (attendee)</blockquote>
          <blockquote class="note">"A meaningful corporate retreat: team members spoke of better focus for days after." — HR Lead, wellness program</blockquote>
          <blockquote class="note">"The facilitator’s voice and the monochord created a field I could rest into." — K. (repeat guest)</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="content-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Practical FAQ</h3>
        <div class="faq-grid">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h4>What to bring?</h4>
            <p>Comfortable layers, a yoga mat or blanket, a pillow for neck support, water, and an eye mask if you prefer darkness. We provide bolsters and extra blankets on request.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h4>Flow of a session</h4>
            <p>Arrival & settling (10–15 min) — intention & brief guidance — progressive sound arc (45–60 min) — soft re-grounding & sharing (10–15 min). You are welcome to rest quietly during sharing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h4>Contraindications</h4>
            <p>If you have epilepsy, are pregnant, have implanted medical devices, or have recent head/ear surgery please consult your physician and notify the facilitator ({{FACILITATOR_NAME}}) before attending. Sessions are not a replacement for medical care.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta-block">
      <div class="wrap cta-row">
        <div>
          <h3>Ready to attend?</h3>
          <p>Reserve a place in our next circle or request a private session for your group.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Contact: {{EMAIL}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <nav>
          <a href="events.html">Events</a>
          <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
          <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="credits">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — All rights reserved.</div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
